{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37442","headline":"乱後经表兄琼华观旧居 · 唐彦谦","name":"乱後经表兄琼华观旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一去仙居似转蓬，再经花谢倚春丛。\n醉中篇什金声在，别後音书锦字空。\n长忆映碑逢若士，未曾携杖逐壶公。\n东风狼籍苔侵径，蕙草香销杏带红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}